     "content_html": "the national government should use its authority to create a standing army"
    },
    {
     "id": 1169022,
     "content_html": "a federal draft law was “necessary and proper,” according to the Constitution"
    },
    {
     "id": 1169025,
     "content_html": "constitutional power supported the state governments in this situation"
    }
